stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Running
  Running --> Saving: execute admitted, native durable profile
  Running --> Running: busy / unsupported / allocation rejected
  Saving --> Running: save or validation failed, no unresolved intent
  Saving --> IntentPublished: completed generation validated, intent written/read back
  IntentPublished --> ReplacingWorld: identity revalidated, Reboot or shutdown
  IntentPublished --> Running: returned failure, owned intent safely consumed
  IntentPublished --> RecoveryHold: failed or uncertain intent cleanup
  ReplacingWorld --> StartupHold: new process detects intent
  StartupHold --> Preflight: validate intent and dimensions
  Preflight --> RecoveryHold: mismatch / malformed / budget refusal
  Preflight --> Importing: matching completed generation
  Importing --> RecoveryHold: failure after mutation; restart original map required
  Importing --> ConsumingIntent: import completed
  ConsumingIntent --> RecoveryHold: intent changed or deletion failed
  ConsumingIntent --> ReclaimPlayers: matching intent consumed, hold released
  ReclaimPlayers --> Running: eligible waiting clients restored
  RecoveryHold --> Preflight: explicit resume only when import not partially failed
  note right of RecoveryHold
    No fresh-round fallback or automatic destructive retry.
    Preserve matched generation and original map.
  end note
